Combined assignment: `x op= expr` bermaksud `x = x op (expr)`. Seluruh sebelah kanan dikira DAHULU.

```
int i = 10, j = 2;
i *= j + 3;              // i = 10 * (2 + 3) = 50

int a = 1; double d = 1.0;
d += 1.5 * 3 + (++a);    // d = 1.0 + (4.5 + 2) = 7.5, a = 2
a = 1; d = 1.0;
d -= 1.5 * 3 + a++;      // d = 1.0 - (4.5 + 1) = -4.5, a = 2

a = 1;
a %= 3 / a + 3;          // a = 1 % 6 = 1

int x, p, q;
x = p = q = 5;           // kanan ke kiri, x+p+q = 15
```

